<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-SELAMAT SEMPURNA H1 NET SHARPLY UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SELAMAT SEMPURNA H1 NET SHARPLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			11.63	 vs     5.97</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  102	  vs	76</p>
<p>    Net sales			   68.87     vs	57.89</p>
<p>    Gross profit			23.01     vs	19.24</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  15.80     vs	12.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    17.07     vs	 9.37</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 23.91     vs	 7.29</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Selamat Sempurna is an automobile spare parts manufacturer.</p>
